07_1351545363214646_5506338495222860567_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BUqKDjWpxiIQ7kNvwFaD66-&_nc_oc=Adr1RCNE4qMaX5qt0dz6pIn0ThcNg88cqfw-5YhW6gz97Zy2yGiw0sgWq8DmH-_DX6k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQISD3AbAR8fBRaX0f6OckrMB5Q7RkW2QCAM7A3r5R0gyA&oe=6AB7D442"}, {"file_name": "ss5.png", "id": "1715729295759342", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305050_1715729299092675_4690986203494255387_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fqJZ-Lndza4Q7kNvwHUBo6J&_nc_oc=AdoqzwlEPDxgv_UBcAnmb6A3AQErwU5PbOrzX4k_ScTjzVFfs9FjJlw9PUY14ijyZOM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKVLCSBWNihmv7BuPfmyLmhY_RmL3XJ_si0fM2cLz1JoA&oe=6AB7C9BF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Portrait.png", "id": "806605711863955", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823486_806605715197288_1898259061609879939_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dhbO7oq75T8Q7kNvwHT9Kya&_nc_oc=AdpwsDbNOFJmreeihmoFTmyrIlbmTzVovbRZ7m4RKVX-gWeEdxGkW_Wp-7t4Is302jc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLyntTEFF0QnEhNIYbyOIpHwRqzXlxqSaSZnhUHKIK23g&oe=6AB7D8B0"}, "display_name": "Afterlife: Dead Zone", "keywords": ["zombies", "shooter", "disparos", "zombis", "horror"], "long_description": "In Afterlife: Dead Zone, you play as a soldier trapped in the Dead Zones, isolated areas where help seems impossible. Humanity teeters on the brink of extinction: ancient alien civilizations have returned to assess our development and, deeming us a threat, unleash weapons of mass destruction that turn people into bloodthirsty monsters.\n\nExplore dark, devastated post-apocalyptic environments where hordes of zombies and mutated creatures can appear around every corner. Your mission is simple but deadly: shoot and avoid dying. While your weapons have infinite ammo, the variety and ferocity of enemies will demand strategy and quic